# Manual postup-prvni-instalace (base side), steps 1, 4, 5, 6. Keep in step with midicontrolpy-sw/docs/manual/docs/postupy.md
# 1: no remote stored, no PC yet: splash, after 3 s the menu titled "Sparuj ovladac" under the "Odpojeno" overlay
state remote=-
state pc=0
expect screen splash
tick 3000
tick 30
expect screen nopc
expect text Odpojeno
state pc=1
tick 30
expect screen main
expect text Sparuj ovladac
# 4: Nastaveni -> Sparovat ovladac -> push: Parovani, Hledam ovladac...
key down
key down
key enter
expect screen settings
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
expect scrolled Sparovat ovladac
key enter
expect screen pairing
expect text Parovani
expect text Hledam ovladac...
# 5: result
event pairing Sparovano
expect text Sparovano
# 6: push closes the screen
key enter
expect screen settings
